="02:26.212">kakimu</span><span begin="02:26.212" end="02:26.647">shi't</span><span begin="02:26.647" end="02:27.190">te</span></text><text for="L20"><span begin="02:27.282" end="02:28.303">fusagareta</span><span begin="02:28.303" end="02:28.865">kyouwo</span><span begin="02:28.865" end="02:29.593">uranda</span></text><text for="L21"><span begin="02:29.603" end="02:30.171">soshite</span><span begin="02:30.171" end="02:30.678">dou</span><span begin="02:30.678" end="02:31.635">kana</span><span begin="02:31.635" end="02:32.692">kusanaide</span><span begin="02:32.692" end="02:33.203">yo'tte</span></text><text for="L22"><span begin="02:33.213" end="02:33.720">kou</span><span begin="02:33.720" end="02:34.382">kashi</span><span begin="02:34.382" end="02:35.062">tasu</span><span begin="02:35.062" end="02:35.628">giru</span><span begin="02:35.628" end="02:35.963">hibi</span><span begin="02:35.963" end="02:36.305">wo</span></text><text for="L23"><span begin="02:36.426" end="02:38.082">koukai</span><span begin="02:38.082" end="02:39.546">shitendayo'tte</span><span begin="02:39.546" end="02:39.915"></span><span begin="02:39.915" end="02:40.288"></span><span begin="02:40.288" end="02:41.432"></span><span begin="02:41.432" end="02:42.165"></span><span begin="02:42.165" end="02:43.023"></span></text><text for="L24"><span begin="03:26.146" end="03:26.797">kimiwoma</span><span begin="03:26.797" end="03:27.178">'t</span><span begin="03:27.178" end="03:27.759">tabo</span></text><text for="L26"><span begin="03:29.231" end="03:30.167">togirenai</span><span begin="03:30.167" end="03:31.010">ashitamo</span><span begin="03:31.010" end="03:31.752">sugitei</span><span begin="03:31.752" end="03:32.325">'tte</span></text><text for="L27"><span begin="03:32.341" end="03:32.902">bokuha</span><span begin="03:32.902" end="03:33.321">kyou</span><span begin="03:33.321" end="03:33.951">moka</span><span begin="03:33.951" end="03:34.288">ki</span><span begin="03:34.288" end="03:34.808">mushi't</span><span begin="03:34.808" end="03:35.402">te</span></text><text for="L28"><span begin="03:35.512" end="03:36.303">surenai</span><span begin="03:36.303" end="03:37.044">kizuwo</span><span begin="03:37.044" end="03:37.772">tsuketei</span><span begin="03:37.772" end="03:38.081">ru</span><span begin="03:38.081" end="03:38.643">nda</span><span begin="03:38.643" end="03:38.844"></span><span begin="03:38.844" end="03:40.020">yo</span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="03:43.257" end="03:43.929">kimi</span><span begin="03:43.929" end="03:44.159">ja</span><span begin="03:44.159" end="03:44.837">nai</span><span begin="03:44.837" end="03:45.089">to</span><span begin="03:45.089" end="03:47.643">sa</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="05:07.133"><div begin="01:16.027" end="03:47.643"><p begin="01:16.027" end="01:17.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="01:16.027" end="01:16.678">君を</span><span begin="01:16.678" end="01:17.059">待っ</span><span begin="01:17.059" end="01:17.640">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着你 我等待着你</span></p><p begin="01:17.743" end="01:19.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="01:17.743" end="01:18.240">僕は</span><span begin="01:18.240" end="01:18.584">待っ</span><span begin="01:18.584" end="01:19.108">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正等着你</span></p><p begin="01:19.220" end="01:22.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="01:19.220" end="01:20.124">途切れない</span><span begin="01:20.124" end="01:20.944">明日も</span><span begin="01:20.944" end="01:21.717">過ぎて行っ</span><span begin="01:21.717" end="01:22.314">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连不曾中断的明天也擦身而过</span></p><p begin="01:22.419" end="01:25.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:22.419" end="01:22.745">立ち</span><span begin="01:22.745" end="01:23.194">止まっ</span><span begin="01:23.194" end="01:23.909">て</span><span begin="01:23.909" end="01:24.317">振り</span><span begin="01:24.317" end="01:24.783">返っ</span><span begin="01:24.783" end="01:25.301">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驻足原地 我蓦然回首</span></p><p begin="01:25.368" end="01:28.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:25.368" end="01:25.853">とめ</span><span begin="01:25.853" end="01:26.310">どない</span><span begin="01:26.310" end="01:26.978">今日を</span><span begin="01:26.978" end="01:27.560">嘆き</span><span begin="01:27.560" end="01:27.932">合っ</span><span begin="01:27.932" end="01:28.512">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们相互哀叹着无止尽的今天</span></p><p begin="01:28.564" end="01:31.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:28.564" end="01:29.128">記憶</span><span begin="01:29.128" end="01:29.480">だっ</span><span begin="01:29.480" end="01:30.101">て</span> <span begin="01:30.101" end="01:30.729">永遠に</span><span begin="01:30.729" end="01:31.072">なん</span><span begin="01:31.072" end="01:31.535">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么记忆 什么永恒</span></p><p begin="01:31.591" end="01:34.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:31.591" end="01:32.379">残らない</span><span begin="01:32.379" end="01:32.876">もの</span><span begin="01:32.876" end="01:33.249">と</span><span begin="01:33.249" end="01:33.803">おもい</span><span begin="01:33.803" end="01:34.549">知って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我慢慢明白那些东西都不会长久</span></p><p begin="01:34.625" end="01:37.758" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:34.625" end="01:35.254">僕は</span><span begin="01:35.254" end="01:36.197">ずっと</span><span begin="01:36.197" end="01:36.625">掻き</span><span begin="01:36.625" end="01:37.192">むしっ</span><span begin="01:37.192" end="01:37.758">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在为此痛苦烦恼</span></p><p begin="01:37.768" end="01:40.165" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:37.768" end="01:38.616">心の</span><span begin="01:38.616" end="01:39.479">隅っこで</span><span begin="01:39.479" end="01:40.165">泣いた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在内心的角落啜泣不止</span></p><p begin="01:40.192" end="01:43.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:40.192" end="01:40.700">そして</span><span begin="01:40.700" end="01:41.135">どう</span><span begin="01:41.135" end="01:41.990">か</span><span begin="01:41.990" end="01:43.133">なくさないで</span><span begin="01:43.133" end="01:43.622">よって</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只希望你千万不要遗忘</span></p><p begin="01:43.632" end="01:46.841" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:43.632" end="01:44.119">高</span><span begin="01:44.119" end="01:44.851">架</span><span begin="01:44.851" end="01:45.537">下、</span><span begin="01:45.537" end="01:46.146">過ぎる</span><span begin="01:46.146" end="01:46.841">日々を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一段在高架下逝去的时光</span></p><p begin="01:46.887" end="01:53.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:46.887" end="01:47.278">後</span><span begin="01:47.278" end="01:48.619">悔</span><span begin="01:48.619" end="01:49.187">してん</span><span begin="01:49.187" end="01:49.925">だよって</span> <span begin="01:49.925" end="01:50.325">そう</span><span begin="01:50.325" end="01:50.770">言い</span><span begin="01:50.770" end="01:51.396">逃</span><span begin="01:51.396" end="01:51.959">した</span><span begin="01:51.959" end="01:52.696">あの</span><span begin="01:52.696" end="01:53.849">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我一直都为此追悔莫及</span></p><p begin="02:05.579" end="02:08.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="02:05.579" end="02:06.272">繋ぎ</span><span begin="02:06.272" end="02:06.640">合っ</span><span begin="02:06.640" end="02:07.280">た</span><span begin="02:07.280" end="02:07.805">時も</span><span begin="02:07.805" end="02:08.192">あっ</span><span begin="02:08.192" end="02:08.733">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们也曾拥有过心灵相通的时光</span></p><p begin="02:08.770" end="02:11.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="02:08.770" end="02:09.657">ほどけない</span><span begin="02:09.657" end="02:10.440">感情</span><span begin="02:10.440" end="02:10.910">持ち</span><span begin="02:10.910" end="02:11.290">寄っ</span><span begin="02:11.290" end="02:11.793">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此寄托着一份无法放手的感情</span></p><p begin="02:11.803" end="02:14.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:11.803" end="02:12.443">それが</span><span begin="02:12.443" end="02:12.822">僕</span><span begin="02:12.822" end="02:13.450">の</span><span begin="02:13.450" end="02:13.985">すべて</span><span begin="02:13.985" end="02:14.336">だっ</span><span begin="02:14.336" end="02:14.867">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经那就是我的全部</span></p><p begin="02:14.867" end="02:17.992" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:14.867" end="02:15.536">それも</span><span begin="02:15.536" end="02:16.165">たった</span><span begin="02:16.165" end="02:16.563">今</span> <span begin="02:16.563" end="02:17.069">失くし</span><span begin="02:17.069" end="02:17.447">たん</span><span begin="02:17.447" end="02:17.992">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而就在刚才我失去了我的全部</span></p><p begin="02:18.048" end="02:21.001" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:18.048" end="02:18.677">形</span><span begin="02:18.677" end="02:19.548">だって</span> <span begin="02:19.548" end="02:20.161">時が</span><span begin="02:20.161" end="02:20.491">経っ</span><span begin="02:20.491" end="02:21.001">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有形的事物 随着时间的流逝</span></p><p begin="02:21.062" end="02:24.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:21.062" end="02:21.708">変わり</span><span begin="02:21.708" end="02:22.055">ゆく</span><span begin="02:22.055" end="02:22.785">ものと</span><span begin="02:22.785" end="02:23.260">おもい</span><span begin="02:23.260" end="02:23.628">知っ</span><span begin="02:23.628" end="02:24.095">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我慢慢明白一切都注定物是人非</span></p><p begin="02:24.144" end="02:27.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:24.144" end="02:24.801">僕は</span><span begin="02:24.801" end="02:25.725">ずっと</span><span begin="02:25.725" end="02:26.212">掻き</span><span begin="02:26.212" end="02:26.647">むしっ</span><span begin="02:26.647" end="02:27.190">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在为此痛苦烦恼</span></p><p begin="02:27.282" end="02:29.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:27.282" end="02:28.303">塞がれた</span><span begin="02:28.303" end="02:28.865">今日を</span><span begin="02:28.865" end="02:29.593">恨んだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怨恨着停滞不前的今天</span></p><p begin="02:29.603" end="02:33.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:29.603" end="02:30.171">そして</span><span begin="02:30.171" end="02:30.678">どう</span><span begin="02:30.678" end="02:31.635">か</span><span begin="02:31.635" end="02:32.692">なくさないで</span><span begin="02:32.692" end="02:33.203">よって</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只希望你千万不要遗忘</span></p><p begin="02:33.213" end="02:36.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:33.213" end="02:33.720">高</span><span begin="02:33.720" end="02:34.382">架</span><span begin="02:34.382" end="02:35.062">下、</span><span begin="02:35.062" end="02:35.628">過ぎる</span><span begin="02:35.628" end="02:35.963">日々</span><span begin="02:35.963" end="02:36.305">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一段在高架下逝去的时光</span></p><p begin="02:36.426" end="02:43.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:36.426" end="02:38.082">後悔</span><span begin="02:38.082" end="02:39.546">してんだよって</span> <span begin="02:39.546" end="02:39.915">そう</span><span begin="02:39.915" end="02:40.288">言い</span><span begin="02:40.288" end="02:41.432">逃した</span><span begin="02:41.432" end="02:42.165">あの</span><span begin="02:42.165" end="02:43.023">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我一直都为此追悔莫及</span></p><p begin="03:26.146" end="03:27.759" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:26.146" end="03:26.797">君を</span><span begin="03:26.797" end="03:27.178">待っ</span><span begin="03:27.178" end="03:27.759">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待着你 我等待着你</span></p><p begin="03:27.718" end="03:29.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="03:27.718" end="03:28.213">僕は</span><span begin="03:28.213" end="03:28.582">待っ</span><span begin="03:28.582" end="03:29.083">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正等着你</span></p><p begin="03:29.231" end="03:32.325" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="03:29.231" end="03:30.167">途切れない</span><span begin="03:30.167" end="03:31.010">明日も</span><span begin="03:31.010" end="03:31.752">過ぎて行っ</span><span begin="03:31.752" end="03:32.325">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连不曾中断的明天也擦身而过</span></p><p begin="03:32.341" end="03:35.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:32.341" end="03:32.902">僕は</span><span begin="03:32.902" end="03:33.321">今日</span><span begin="03:33.321" end="03:33.951">も</span><span begin="03:33.951" end="03:34.288">掻き</span><span begin="03:34.288" end="03:34.808">むしっ</span><span begin="03:34.808" end="03:35.402">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天我依然在为此痛苦烦恼</span></p><p begin="03:35.512" end="03:40.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:35.512" end="03:36.303">忘れない</span><span begin="03:36.303" end="03:37.044">傷を</span><span begin="03:37.044" end="03:37.772">つけ</span><span begin="03:37.772" end="03:38.081">て</span><span begin="03:38.081" end="03:38.643">いるん</span><span begin="03:38.643" end="03:38.844">だ</span><span begin="03:38.844" end="03:40.020">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留下了永远难以忘却的伤痛</span></p><p begin="03:43.257" end="03:47.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:43.257" end="03:43.929">君</span><span begin="03:43.929" end="03:44.159">じゃ</span><span begin="03:44.159" end="03:44.837">ない</span><span begin="03:44.837" end="03:45.089">と</span><span begin="03:45.089" end="03:47.643">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我依旧非你不可</span></p></div></body></tt>